    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68388" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολυβδο-χοέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>melt lead, work as a plumber</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>fix with molten lead</i>, e.g. a statue on its pedestal, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ πόδε μ. περὶ τὰ σφυρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					1110
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1672.176
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Athens</span>),<i><span class="en">
				7.3073.179
			</span></i>,al. (Lebad.).</div>
